# Python

- Pydantic v2 models at every process/IO boundary.
- Full type annotations. `mypy --strict` must pass.
- No `print` outside `src/harpy/cli.py` and `src/harpy/tui/`.
- No bare `subprocess`. Use `harpy.proc.run`.
- Prefer explicit errors over silent defaults when a dependency (`gh`, `git`) is missing.
- Config weights and the default model live in `harpy.config`, not call sites.
